---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Cybersecurity Research Notebook">
  <article class="about-page">
    <h1>About This Notebook</h1>
    <p>
      Welcome to this technical research notebook. This site is dedicated to documenting personal experiments, low-level reverse engineering, Windows kernel analysis, and security research workflows.
    </p>

    <h2>Research Focus</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Windows Internals & Architecture</li>
      <li>Windows Kernel Driver Analysis</li>
      <li>Static Analysis with IDA Pro & Ghidra</li>
      <li>Dynamic Debugging with WinDbg</li>
      <li>LLM-assisted Vulnerability Discovery & Methodology</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      All content published on this site consists of personal security research notes, technical tutorials, and open methodology observations performed in isolated local lab environments.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .about-page h2 {
    margin-top: 1.8rem;
  }
</style>
